  "metadata": {
    "id": "bottling",
    "name": "Bottling Plant",
    "author": "ChronoSplit",
    "description": "A sealed bottling works, in the spirit of GoldenEye's Facility: tiled washrooms with a ceiling vent you can drop through, long service corridors, a two-storey server lab, and the great tank hall where walkways cross between the tank tops. The railgun waits on the walkway junction; the gilded pistol hides in the stalls below the vent.",
